### External dependencies

::deps{type="lib" :external="true" :dependencies='[{"text": "motion-v", "url": "https://motion-v.com"}]'}
::

### Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `items` | `Array` | `[]` | List of available filters. |
| `activeFilters` | `Array` | `undefined` | Controlled list of active filter IDs. |
| `theme` | `string` | `'dark'` | UI theme: `'dark'` or `'light'`. |

### Events

| Event | Payload | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `@update:activeFilters` | `string[]` | Emitted when filters are updated (v-model). |
| `@filterChange` | `string[]` | Emitted when a filter selection changes. |
